title: Saint Patrick Was a Baptist
description: Patrick as a Baptist missionary sent to Ireland by the independent church in Britain, in his own words from the Confessio: salvation by grace through faith, the new birth, a great soul winner, an independent church free from Rome, and believer’s baptism.
